id: pm-i4kxx1
title: Accept universal SDK read receipts in the public context evaluation reader
description: "Strict compilation against the candidate packed SDK proves that PmClient cannot satisfy ContextEvaluationReader: context/next return a universal result that may contain output_budget_exceeded, even for an unbounded request when shared budgets bind. The existing documentation passes PmClient directly. A guard-aware adapter can make the example correct now, but the evaluator should compose with the public reader contract itself and refuse omitted data before grading."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
