author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: Direct PmClient and structural reader integrations compile without casts; context and next results retain universal budget refusal types; infeasible or shared-budget omissions fail explicitly before scoring instead of being treated as empty ranked context; complete results preserve metrics and attribution; published Node/Bun and strict TypeScript consumers prove the contract
parent: pm-atfm
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: Public evaluator readers compose directly with PmClient while handling typed budget refusals before scoring.
