comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-11T17:04:26.652Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status corpus, exact ContextEvaluationReader keyword search (zero hits), evaluation/PmClient searches, fresh open and active inventories, and full live pm-atfm metadata/comments/raw history were inspected. The completed runner lineage remains completed. This new task tracks the reproduced universal-read composition gap under the canonical evaluation feature; it stays open and unclaimed while the connected documentation supplies a typed fail-closed adapter."
  "2026-10-11T17:06:33.841Z","harness:codex","Additional strict consumer evidence: after narrowing the budget-refusal variant with isReadOutputBudgetExceeded, ContextResult and NextResult still fail the reader interface because its string index signature excludes those exported interfaces. A typed adapter that guards refusals and returns a shallow object copy composes without casts while preserving every packet field. This is a structural type and refusal-contract gap, not a claim that the completed evaluation algorithm is unfinished."
